        "content": [
          "To initiate the process, start by receiving the order.",
          "At the same time, complete the following steps: check the order and check the customer.",
          "If the order is okay, then continue with the process.",
          "However, if the customer is permitted, continue with the process.",
          "Release the order and then transfer the data in the database.",
          "Once the data is transferred, check the worth of the order. If it is greater than 10.000 \u20ac,",
          "sign off on the order.",
          "Sign off on the order and forward it to production.",
          "At the same time, complete the following steps: check the product quality, start production, and produce the product.",
          "Also, create a material report.",
          "Once the report is created, send it to the warehouse.",
          "At the same time, create a quality report, send the product to shipment, and send the order to accounting.",
          "Once the report is created, send it to Finance.",
          "After sending the report, archive it. Archive the report and end the process."
        ]
      },
